  "label": "school-aged children and adolescents",
  "description": "The meme targets school-aged children and adolescents who are familiar with classroom dynamics, particularly the experience of being 'roasted' by a teacher, and who understand the slang term 'homie' as referring to a close friend. The visual of a child dressed as a scientist holding a bomb, combined with the text about a teacher roasting them and a bomb going off, is designed to resonate with this demographic who can relate to school-based humor and the trope of retaliating against authority figures through pranks or jokes.",
